<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-taipingyulan" book-id="b-taipingyulan-718" chapter-id="c-taipingyulan-718-wangbaoming" source-id="s-taipingyulan-718-wangbaoming-ws2611083">
  <p id="c-taipingyulan-718-wangbaoming:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">《齊書》曰：<persName id="c-taipingyulan-718-wangbaoming:p001:m0006" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">文安皇后</persName>為皇太子妃，無寵。太子為宮人制新麗衣裳及首飾，而后床惟陳故古舊釵鑷數枚。</p>
</text>
